                        <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-right: 8px;"></i> <span class="plan-undo-limit">5</span> Tindbook undos / day</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-right: 8px;"></i> Critic Badge & sharing honors</li>
